{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.YekutieliLiftingCondition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.YekutieliLiftingCondition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.lift_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.lift_iff","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.lean#L50-L60","doc":"An object lifts iff its obstruction is zero (the iff formulation).\nCombines lift_of_zero and no_lift_of_nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.no_lift_of_nonzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.no_lift_of_nonzero","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Non-zero obstruction prevents lifting. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.lift_of_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.lift_of_zero","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The lifting exists when the obstruction vanishes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.LiftType","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.LiftType","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.lean#L42-L42","doc":"The type of lifts at level n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.obstruction","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The obstruction map: each object (indexed by ℕ for the tower)\ngets an obstruction class in H²(𝒮, ℬ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.addCommGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.addCommGroup","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The obstruction space is an additive commutative group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.ObstructionSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.ObstructionSpace","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.lean#L35-L35","doc":"The obstruction space (representing H²(𝒮, ℬ)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutieliLiftingCondition","kind":"structure","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.lean#L23-L46","doc":"The Yekutieli lifting condition for a category with gerbe structure.\n\nGiven a central extension of gerbes\n  1 → ℬ → 𝔊' → 𝔊 → 1\nbanded by an abelian sheaf ℬ on a site 𝒮, each object x ∈ Ob(𝔊)\nhas an obstruction class κ(x) ∈ H²(𝒮, ℬ), and x admits a lift\nto 𝔊' if and only if κ(x) = 0.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:yekutieli-lifting-condition}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:yekutieli-lifting-condition","label":"def:yekutieli-lifting-condition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-condition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}